ients in a large stainless steel bowl. She is mixing a generous amount of finely shredded white vegetables (appearing to be Korean radish/mu) with her bare hands, fluffing and tossing the strands to ensure even distribution.\n\nOn-screen Korean text appears throughout: the first caption mentions "천연 소화제 무가 들어가 깔끔하고 속도 편한 무만두" (moo/dumplings with natural digestive enzymes that are clean and comfortable for digestion). Later text on frames 223-226 reads "두 번째 채쓸기까지 완료" indicating the completion of the second round of cutting/shredding the vegetables.\n\nThe mood is practical and instructional, typical of a cooking demonstration, with the focus on the tactile preparation of ingredients.', 'similarity score': 0.6994876861572266}, {'clip_435_439': 'clip_435_439', 'text': 'In this sequence, a woman in a white shirt and light green apron is preparing food in a modern Korean home setting. \n\n**Frame 435s** shows a close-up of her hands working with a small piece of white dough or filling, with houseplants visible in the bright background. The show title "편스토랑" appears in the top-left corner alongside text mentioning "500원."\n\n**Frames 436-437s** switch to a wide shot revealing her sitting on the floor at a low white table equipped with a large metal mixing bowl, smaller bowls, and cooking utensils. The room features wooden flooring, a dark accent wall with an intercom, and potted plants.\n\n**Frames 438-439s** continue the wide shot as she manipulates the food with her hands, while Korean text appears on the right: *"엄마랑 통화하니까 옛날 생각난다"* ("Talking with mom reminds me of old times"). \n\nThe scene conveys a calm, nostalgic domestic mood, emphasizing traditional home cooking in a contemporary setting.', 'similarity score': 0.6979950666427612}, {'clip_163_167': 'clip_163_167', 'text': 'In this kitchen scene, a woman wearing a light green apron and a smartwatch prepares ingredients by dehydrating them using a manual method. \n\n**163s–164s:** Close-up shots show her hands wrap